{"2004640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Svarog's Dream", "steam_appid": 2004640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2982030], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-changing World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Svarog's Dream, the absolute freedom to explore the world and make decisions is yours. However, every action influences the world around you, for better or worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soul Lost Between Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a lost soul, inhabiting human hosts who are desperate enough to embrace you. With each death, you revisit the underworld to possess a new body from a selection of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pawn in the Game of Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While humans wage their wars on Earth, the Gods clash against each other in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with their immense power, they search for a means to gain momentum in their eternal battles. All existence is bound by the threads of destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power of free will, a gift the gods will go to great lengths to persuade to their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/extras/48285e558062cea5f3b89545de74d727.avif?t=1784213526\" width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The old prophecy:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Svarog, the first god, created six worlds and fell asleep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In his dream, he created the seventh world, Earth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once he wakes up, Earth will cease to exist.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a living, responsive world filled with emergent stories, while also experiencing over 100 handcrafted quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, cook, sleep, craft potions, upgrade gear, buy houses, take loans, and even evade debt collectors or headhunters, among much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character build using abilities from 12 unique classes, and equip them with hundreds of weapons, armor pieces, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/extras/ee113f83e6c2183956de3bc329e1948e.avif?t=1784213526\" width=800 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;We took everything we loved about old-school RPGs and then added a modern twist on top of it all.&quot;</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-changing World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Svarog's Dream, the absolute freedom to explore the world and make decisions is yours. However, every action influences the world around you, for better or worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soul Lost Between Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a lost soul, inhabiting human hosts who are desperate enough to embrace you. With each death, you revisit the underworld to possess a new body from a selection of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pawn in the Game of Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While humans wage their wars on Earth, the Gods clash against each other in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with their immense power, they search for a means to gain momentum in their eternal battles. All existence is bound by the threads of destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power of free will, a gift the gods will go to great lengths to persuade to their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/extras/48285e558062cea5f3b89545de74d727.avif?t=1784213526\" width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The old prophecy:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Svarog, the first god, created six worlds and fell asleep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In his dream, he created the seventh world, Earth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once he wakes up, Earth will cease to exist.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a living, responsive world filled with emergent stories, while also experiencing over 100 handcrafted quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, cook, sleep, craft potions, upgrade gear, buy houses, take loans, and even evade debt collectors or headhunters, among much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character build using abilities from 12 unique classes, and equip them with hundreds of weapons, armor pieces, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/extras/ee113f83e6c2183956de3bc329e1948e.avif?t=1784213526\" width=800 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;We took everything we loved about old-school RPGs and then added a modern twist on top of it all.&quot;</i></p>", "short_description": "Awaken as a soul from the Underworld. Discover who you are and explore an ever-changing open world full of mystery. Battle beasts and gods, or forge alliances with them. Die and be reborn in this adventure.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/15958005931edec56bd9885e280f321f9ffde884/header.jpg?t=1784213526", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/5996cd632a2fae5a7ce7d755bbacd475755e5e25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784213526", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2004640/5996cd632a2fae5a7ce7d755bbacd475755e5e25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784213526", "website": "https://www.svarogsdream.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 3 5300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "devel